{
  "tema": 5058,
  "slug": "preposicion-quien",
  "titulo": "Asking about people with preposition + quién",
  "subtitulo": "¿De quién es? ¿Con quién fuiste? ¿Para quién son?",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "To ask whose, to whom, with whom, for whom, put the preposition before quién / quiénes: ¿De quién es? ¿Con quién fuiste? Use quiénes when you expect more than one person.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In English the preposition often goes at the end: _Who did you go **with**?_ In Spanish it goes **first**, right before **quién**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "¿",
            "preposition + quién / quiénes",
            "...?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Quién** has a plural, **quiénes**, when you expect more than one person."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Whose?** is **¿De quién...?** Spanish has no single word for it."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Watch out: the preposition can differ from English: **pensar en** (_think about_), **enamorarse de** (_fall in love with_)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **¿De quién?** = _whose?_, the owner always comes with **de**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "¿==De quién== es esa casa?",
              "en": "Whose house is that?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Con quién== fuiste al cine ayer?",
              "en": "Who did you go to the movies with yesterday?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==A quién== le mandaste la carta?",
              "en": "Who did you send the letter to?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Para quién== compraste esas flores tan bonitas?",
              "en": "Who did you buy those pretty flowers for?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Con quiénes== se van de vacaciones?",
              "en": "Who are you all going on vacation with?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==De quiénes== son esos libros?",
              "en": "Whose books are those?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Por quién== harías una locura?",
              "en": "Who would you do something crazy for?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==En quién== estás pensando? ¿En Marcos o en Álvaro?",
              "en": "Who are you thinking about? Marcos or Álvaro?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "¿Quién fuiste con?"
                },
